@startuml intake_flow
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
' intake_flow — v29.1: the interview. Everything left of the card is words;
' the model is one optional box; the C++ path is complete without it.
' ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
!include _style.puml

title The intake interview (v29.1) — three answer tiers, one boundary

rectangle "NEEDS DETAILS queue\n(derived, briefing §K.1)" as queue
rectangle "triage (C++, §K.6)\ndeadline ∨ urgent ∨\nheavy-history area;\nnever if dismissed" as triage
rectangle "the question (C++, §K.2)\n+ guess from history (§K.3)\n\"Lab 4 — how long?\n(2 finished School tasks\nran ~2h — sound right?)\"" as question
rectangle "≈ guess button" as guessbtn
rectangle "typed answer" as typed
rectangle "Skip\n→ dismissTask(+1y)\nowner's act, own door" as skipbtn
rectangle "crisp parse (C++)\n\"2h\" / \"1h30\" / \"90 min\"\nrefuses prose on purpose" as crisp
rectangle "IntakeClient → model\nJSON out, no tool API\n(runs on every seat,\nOllama included)" as model
rectangle "honest hint\n\"give me something\nlike 2h\" — stays open" as hint
rectangle "verbs::Proposal\n→ the Slice 1 card\n→ your tap → the door" as card

queue --> triage
triage --> question
question --> guessbtn
question --> typed
question --> skipbtn
guessbtn --> card : the guess crosses\nthe card too
typed --> crisp
crisp --> card : parsed
crisp --> model : not a plain\nduration
model --> card : extracted
model --> hint : couldn't read /\nseat down
skipbtn ..> question : next task\n(ask once: never\nthis one again)
card ..> question : settle → next

note bottom of card
  Slice 1 unchanged: validate, re-validate at
  the tap, additive only, copy-aside, receipt.
  The model swapped in as a proposer — nothing
  right of the card moved.
end note

@enduml
